# ── Original assets: never commit or deploy ────────────────────────────────
# Full-resolution originals (~1.2 GB) live outside the project in
# ../sampann-original-assets. These patterns stop them being added back by
# mistake. Optimised website images (public/images/*.webp, public/images/og/)
# are NOT ignored.
